version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-10
keywords:
  - block cipher
  - Feistel network
  - chaos-based cryptography
  - logistic map
  - key-derived S-box
  - authenticated encryption
  - encrypt-then-MAC
  - key derivation
  - cross-validation
